<TD WIDTH="2%" VALIGN="top">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">Revenue of $14.9&nbsp;billion, up 8% year over year; GAAP EPS of $0.72, up 6% year over year; and <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Non-GAAP</FONT> EPS of $1.00, up 10% year over year, above the high end of our guidance ranges and demonstrating solid operating leverage </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
