<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">GAAP gross margin of 65.5% and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Non-GAAP</FONT> gross margin of 68.1%; GAAP
operating margin of 22.6% and <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Non-GAAP</FONT> operating margin of 34.4%, both above the high end of our guidance ranges </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:4pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
